riginal work is properly cited.</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2007</copyright-year><related-article xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pcbi.0020172" related-article-type="corrected-article" xlink:title="Research Article" vol="2" page="e172" id="RA1" ext-link-type="doi"><article-title>Computational Model Explains High Activity and Rapid Cycling of Rho GTPases within Protein Complexes			</article-title></related-article><counts><page-count count="1"/></counts><custom-meta-wrap><custom-meta><meta-name>citation</meta-name><meta-value>(2007) Correction: Computational Model Explains High Activity and Rapid Cycling of Rho GTPases within Protein Complexes. PLoS Comput Biol 3(7): e136. doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pcbi.0030136">10.1371/journal.pcbi.0030136</ext-link></meta-value></custom-meta></custom-meta-wrap></article-meta></front><body><p>In <italic>PLoS Computational Biology</italic>, volume 2, issue 12: <ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pcbi.0020172">10.1371/journal.pcbi.0020172</ext-link></p><p>In Table 2, the first line was missing the last term: &#x02212;<italic>k</italic><sub>12</sub><italic>RD&#x000b7;M</italic>. The same term was incorrectly presented in the second equation: &#x0002b;<italic>k</italic><sub>12</sub><italic>&#x000b7;M</italic> (the "RD" was missing). In the third line, the term <italic>k</italic><sub>43</sub><italic>RE&#x000b7;D</italic> was incorrectly presented as <italic>k</italic><sub>43</sub><italic>RT&#x000b7;D</italic>. The correct <xref ref-type="table" rid="pcbi-0030136-t001">Table 2</xref> is below.</p><table-wrap id="pcbi-0030136-t001" content-type="2col" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Model Equations</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="pcbi.0030136.t001"/></table-wrap></body></article>